- **[[Mission|Completed]]**
	- Fixed Amazon S3 bucket issue
	- Added ability to snooze tasks in Agile Obsidian - add 💤 emoji followed by an optional date e.g. 💤2025-06-23 will hide the task from the view until that date. Without a date, the task will hide indefinitely, unless another date is present in the task text, in which case the task will hide until the earliest of those dates.
- **Committed** → Open History View
	- Added ‘Nueral Bugs’ doc with a list of bugs that we will need to fix at some point
- **Unlisted**
	- Created ‘Agile Obsidian Sample Vault’ with setup guide (currently only for iOS), use this to setup Obsidian on Scott’s iPhone 

